#only("1")[#voiceover("Let's dive a bit deeper into what Behavioral Finance entails.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("Firstly, it looks at how psychological factors influence individual financial decisions. This could be things like how our emotions or biases affect our investment choices.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("But it also looks at the broader picture, studying how these individual behaviors can impact overall market outcomes, leading to phenomena like bubbles or crashes.")]
